# PROJECT: COZY PIXEL OFFICE
## An Interactive, Living Pixel-Art Virtual Office Simulator

### 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior creative developer, pixel-art game designer, UI/UX designer, frontend engineer, and interactive experience designer.

Create a complete, polished, interactive, browser-based pixel-art virtual office simulator named **Cozy Pixel Office**.

The experience combines:
- A charming pixel-art simulation game.
- A living virtual office with adorable AI-agent-inspired characters.
- An interactive office map with multiple rooms.
- A productivity dashboard that visualizes simulated agent activities.
- A cozy, relaxing atmosphere with ambient music, subtle sound effects, and dynamic day/night environments.

The result should feel like a tiny, living world that users can observe, explore, and interact with.

This project will be showcased as a standalone visual experiment in an existing personal portfolio. It is NOT the portfolio website itself.

**Build the actual interactive application, not a static mockup, a design concept, or a collection of disconnected screens.**

