- Application name: Cozy Pixel Office.
- Current in-world time.
- Current environment indicator: Morning, Afternoon, Evening, or Night.
- Active agents count.
- Completed tasks count.
- Notification button.
- Music toggle and volume control.
- Light/dark mode toggle.
- Settings button.

Use small pixel-art icons where appropriate.

Keep the header compact so it does not compete with the environment.

### Left sidebar

Create a collapsible navigation sidebar containing:

- Overview.
- Virtual Office.
- Agents.
- Tasks.
- Activity Log.
- Settings.

Below the navigation, display a miniature agent roster.

Each roster item should include:
- Small character portrait.
- Agent name.
- Current activity.
- Status indicator.
- Optional progress indicator.

Selecting an agent must open its details without requiring navigation to a separate website.

### Central workspace

The central workspace contains the interactive pixel-art office.

It should occupy most of the available viewport.

The office must be visually rich, animated, and explorable.

Include:
- Multiple interconnected rooms.
- Animated characters.
- Furniture and equipment.
- Windows and environmental decorations.
- Camera panning and zooming.
- Interactive character selection.
- Clickable furniture and room entrances.
- A small map or room navigation interface.

### Right-side inspector

Create a contextual inspector panel.

When the user selects an agent, display:
- Agent portrait.
- Name and role.
- Current activity.
- Current task.
- Task description.
- Progress.
- Task status.
- Previous completed tasks.
- Upcoming tasks.
- Current room.
- Behavioral state.
- Interaction controls.

When no agent is selected, display a compact overview with:
- Active agents.
- Tasks in progress.
- Completed tasks.
- Recent activity.
