## 4.2. Responsive Layout

The application must work smoothly on:
- Desktop monitors.
- Laptops.
- Tablets.
- Mobile browsers.

On desktop, prioritize the immersive office canvas.

On tablets, make the side panels collapsible.

On mobile:
- Prioritize the office canvas.
- Use compact floating controls.
- Move agent details into a bottom sheet or slide-over panel.
- Provide accessible room navigation.
- Ensure touch gestures work naturally.
- Prevent the dashboard from making the office canvas unusably small.

The application must remain fully functional even when viewed in a narrow viewport.

Do not simply shrink the desktop layout to fit mobile.

